    // Therefore, a subset S contributes nonzero iff every connected component
    // of S is a path. If S has c components and |S|=m, then total vertices used
    // in these components is m+c, so after contracting each component to one block,
    // the number of objects is N-(m+c)+c = N-m. Number of permutations:
    //   (N-m)! * 2^c
